<title>UK: CIC sets $100 mln perpetual step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>CIC sets $100 mln perpetual step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE FINANCIERE DE CIC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+55 BP    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BAA1/=    ISS PRICE  99.51     FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS WHEN COUPON THEN STEPS</p>
<p>		UP TO 3M LIBOR +1.30 BP FOR YEARS 6-10 AND 3M LIBOR</p>
<p>		+205 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
